WEBVTT

00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:02.020
Hey kids — have you heard about this place?

00:00:02.120 --> 00:00:05.120
South of downtown, old porch houses line the trees.

00:00:06.120 --> 00:00:08.130
Look — the creek winds past the park!

00:00:08.230 --> 00:00:09.780
Everyone knows their lettered street.
